{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T12:53:33.671Z","ordinal":17139,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2","session_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","root_turn_id":"01a0fffd-8886-7310-944d-7ba3e2dd48e9","response_id":"resp_08092949d98b672f016ac0f9dcdadc87d2bebe39d7553de950","usage":{"input_tokens":210882,"cached_input_tokens":210048,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":5887,"reasoning_output_tokens":0,"total_tokens":216769},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":4585182,"cached_input_tokens":4553344,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":18731,"reasoning_output_tokens":6807,"total_tokens":4603913},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":294587587,"cached_input_tokens":290520192,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":872201,"reasoning_output_tokens":304469,"total_tokens":295459788}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T12:53:33.678Z","ordinal":17140,"type":"compacted","payload":{"compaction_response_id":"resp_08092949d98b672f016ac0f9dcdadc87d2bebe39d7553de950","first_window_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-870c4ebd994a","guardian_history":[{"content":[{"text":"Start from branch `codex/mos-aster-racing-city` in `entireio/marvin`. Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/simulator-agent-rules.md`, and follow those instructions throughout the session.\n\nInspect the branch and working tree without discarding changes. Fetch the remote and update safely if needed. Follow the Entire session attachment and trailer verification requirements for every commit.\n\nThen ask me: **“What would you like to work on next?”** Wait for my answer before making changes.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fd98-3767-7440-ade8-38af43a729d1","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790961006.439423,"turn_id":"01a0fd98-3151-7b32-a2f4-a06fc6d958d7"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"The sound design is awful. None of the droids have a driving sound that gets louder with higher speeds. No boost sound either. Instead, they just make way too many squeaking noises. The city is quiet as well. The race is a joke. Your goal is to fix this and implement a sound design that matches AAA game. Use a judge on Codex Astra Ultra to make sure you don’t deliver poor work again.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fd9b-bc4e-7812-a19a-70a924aec95a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790961237.070703,"turn_id":"01a0fd9b-bbfd-77b1-bd1a-3963a2bc9694"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Don’t forget the sand storm and sounds for it","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fda7-7970-7352-90e0-116ed229ecd5","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790962006.384774,"turn_id":"01a0fd9b-bbfd-77b1-bd1a-3963a2bc9694"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"What's the scratching noise that Marvin is making and why does WALL-E sound like a screwdriver?\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fddf-bdcc-7471-990a-9a609331cae2","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790965693.900144,"turn_id":"01a0fddf-bb06-7f53-8a99-51781430bbb0"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"The judge compared that to real WALL-E and thought it fits? I have a hard time believing that. The boost sounds awful too. Anyway, another round please. Also, when driving through narrow gaps in the city, the POV camera does weird things. Also also, the track edge has two holes near the gate. Fix all these. \n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fde3-a619-7c60-ad82-46c3287376aa","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790965949.977842,"turn_id":"01a0fde3-a5a7-79e1-9f62-f5e0396645ef"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Treat the exit to the service area the same as the exit at the gate.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fdf9-b564-7b60-a71a-f325b58f78df","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790967395.684576,"turn_id":"01a0fde3-a5a7-79e1-9f62-f5e0396645ef"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"The ramp is too obviously separated from the infield area. That’s not how sand works.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe1c-590e-7f02-a0cc-53c00ee5399d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790969665.806971,"turn_id":"01a0fde3-a5a7-79e1-9f62-f5e0396645ef"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"wtf, now you created a hard line between ramp and track that makes no sense","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe35-af6e-7050-a678-7b877e1cbefd","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790971326.318149,"turn_id":"01a0fde3-a5a7-79e1-9f62-f5e0396645ef"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Why do we have to discuss the same problems over and over again?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe36-bd1a-70d2-9d31-d38789ef9048","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790971395.354139,"turn_id":"01a0fde3-a5a7-79e1-9f62-f5e0396645ef"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Next, measure the frame rate when driving through town. Are we still at a constant 60fps? It felt a bit stuttery on my MacBook Air M4.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe37-1635-7041-acb3-c412009588f1","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790971418.165391,"turn_id":"01a0fe37-15f1-7f22-b4a5-b0a4836328aa"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"The track also should now have a shoulder on the exit ramp","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe37-7229-7af3-a5f9-b5f705f164cb","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790971441.705806,"turn_id":"01a0fe37-71f5-7f73-b5da-71ca5eb76b98"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Compare both ramps off the track. Show me aerial shots and judge them.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe37-fdee-7b32-9c59-d2f2bd2b46b9","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790971477.486852,"turn_id":"01a0fe37-71f5-7f73-b5da-71ca5eb76b98"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Fix it then for both ramps.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fe62-2ccc-7c12-8273-6626b91c859a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790974241.996603,"turn_id":"01a0fe62-2ca0-73d3-8f61-55bf53020098"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Next, measure the frame rate when driving through town. Are we still at a constant 60fps? It felt a bit stuttery on my MacBook Air M4.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fea0-5109-7ea0-b58d-5c05772ee627","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790978314.505465,"turn_id":"01a0fea0-4eb6-70f2-aa7d-fd496fc9f73c"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Next, measure the frame rate when driving through town. Are we still at a constant 60fps? It felt a bit stuttery on my MacBook Air M4.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fea1-02c7-7842-ab65-dd6d75e27248","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790978360.007394,"turn_id":"01a0fea0-4eb6-70f2-aa7d-fd496fc9f73c"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Debut the slowdown","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fea8-c035-7ca1-8636-8cfc2415897e","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790978867.25378,"turn_id":"01a0fea8-bff8-7e70-8654-2b91708877ae"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Can you add the frame rate to the UI?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fee5-a806-72e1-bdce-0664153be778","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790982858.758679,"turn_id":"01a0fee5-a52e-7a71-8527-fba9fa665dc4"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Now play for 10min. Does the shown fps stay at 60?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fefd-e1f6-7520-9f27-2f34c57a2a3d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790984446.454271,"turn_id":"01a0fefd-def9-7e91-bda8-194ba5f4e43f"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Ok, so where did you go wrong given you claimed no frame rate drops for days now?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ff0e-aae2-7711-a01f-7a34654ce47c","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790985546.466529,"turn_id":"01a0fefd-def9-7e91-bda8-194ba5f4e43f"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Make a plan to fix it, fix it, validate it, and add proper testing so this never happens again. Your goal is to achieve constant 60fps over 10min without reducing the game’s level of details. In fact, we need more headroom to achieve even higher quality.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ff17-16fe-70b0-9e82-e7a56a21a149","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790986098.430386,"turn_id":"01a0ff17-13fd-7563-b654-73f8e5d3ea82"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Doesn’t Apple provide tooling to measure this instead of you doing wild guesses?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ff9f-ca47-7263-86e9-a71d4999b839","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790995057.223647,"turn_id":"01a0ff17-13fd-7563-b654-73f8e5d3ea82"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Request the screen recording permissions please","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ffae-bd5e-7fb3-abce-5298ca8dbd7f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790996036.958577,"turn_id":"01a0ffae-bb32-7c53-9633-3bbcff43ec56"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"You are not requesting it. You are bringing up a custom UI that I can’t use.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ffaf-9863-77e3-942b-d5fbd873c477","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790996093.0277,"turn_id":"01a0ffaf-9832-7720-bb5d-8398e36192a5"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Ok, open the custom UI again please\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ffc9-0e39-7e43-9fc1-fe890c555c56","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790997761.593374,"turn_id":"01a0ffc9-0bf0-7b90-957f-a502a6a33599"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\u003csend_user_message_question_reply\u003e\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_lILC0ZpASbuY4y6qqtpiGywP\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"May I install Apple’s free Xcode app from the Mac App Store? The HUD reports use generic encoder names; Xcode’s Metal debugger and Instruments would let me inspect the actual shaders, resource uploads, and CPU/GPU scheduling. Apple lists a 3.1 GB download, with additional disk space needed after installation.\",\"answer\":\"Install Xcode\"}]\n\u003c/send_user_message_question_reply\u003e","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ffd8-c182-7573-b185-e73fd1178620","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790998790.530343,"turn_id":"01a0ffc9-0bf0-7b90-957f-a502a6a33599"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Yes\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ffe1-0b58-7a61-8257-fe01c4b762e3","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1790999333.720382,"turn_id":"01a0ffe1-0949-71c2-b88a-50af964eee63"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Done","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0ffee-a6e2-7ab1-8f6b-f9337a3ac949","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791000225.506323,"turn_id":"01a0ffee-a66f-78e3-baf3-cc1d16910524"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Okay, and now we wait for what?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fffd-2fb6-78b0-844f-38788c3987af","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791001178.038106,"turn_id":"01a0fffd-2da0-75b1-9ab8-e0b0bd628175"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Should have or are you doing it?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0fffd-88e4-77a3-987d-9ab8590fcf4d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791001200.868506,"turn_id":"01a0fffd-8886-7310-944d-7ba3e2dd48e9"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"You are still playing the guessing game. Can you not measure CPU/GPU consumption with full details on what takes how much time?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a10186-6106-7e81-86ac-1d3c68650bd1","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791026946.310104,"turn_id":"01a10182-70d7-7b71-9c72-962423519979"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Ignore my M4. Focus only on this M2.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a101ad-2763-7262-9653-e786a36db3d9","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791029487.459997,"turn_id":"01a101ab-e536-7c10-a64a-36c533f318c3"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Why is the audio taking to much CPU time?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a101af-b984-7161-978e-15acc7fd6687","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791029655.94,"turn_id":"01a101ab-e536-7c10-a64a-36c533f318c3"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Hm, how many CPU cores can the game use?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a101b1-69f2-77b3-ae78-e84b4f4eb729","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791029766.642298,"turn_id":"01a101ab-e536-7c10-a64a-36c533f318c3"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Come up with a plan to optimize the GPU. Do we have too many vertexes? Do we render things that aren’t visible? Are there other game developer techniques to improve this?","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a101c1-3e6c-7643-a35c-89d52e434cbf","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1791030804.076989,"turn_id":"01a101ab-e536-7c10-a64a-36c533f318c3"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_08092949d98b672f016ac0f89d50f487d2aa411