s\\\"] as? Int ?? 0)\u003e0 }\\n+            \u0026\u0026 inventory.contains { ($0[\\\"insideCameraFrustum\\\"] as? Bool)==true }\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"apps/simulator-macos/build-app.sh \u003e /Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix/visibility-build-final.log 2\u003e\u00261\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031616.380229,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_2wl3YnTiBa7JjTlpOPJlW4r1","id":"ctco_01a101ce-323b-7132-8dd2-da00b8316b6c","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031652.923169,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.2 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"f9d4e0\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.003108,\"session_id\":41403,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_08092949d98b672f016ac0f96c650c87d295d6d10f73d9ef21","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"arguments":"{\"target\":\"/root/astra_ultra_final_judge\",\"message\":\"REDACTED\"}","call_id":"call_7z7KPhtX1O4qpigN9hqFEopj","id":"fc_08092949d98b672f016ac0f979905887d2a7910563532c57f4","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031657.555087,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"name":"followup_task","namespace":"collaboration","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_7z7KPhtX1O4qpigN9hqFEopj","id":"fco_01a101ce-977c-7e41-b283-fa3182120368","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031678.844922,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"o