{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T13:04:23.010Z","ordinal":17429,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a101dd-9be1-7230-b0b2-7944f74284c0","author":"/root/astra_ultra_final_judge","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/astra_ultra_final_judge\nPayload:\nNo blocker to committing these as diagnostics. Visibility controls remain sound, and both supplied GPU runs explicitly retain production shadow batching.\n\nThree qualifications:\n\n- **Default probe baseline:** without `MARVIN_GPU_PRODUCTION_SHADOW_BATCH=1`, blocks named `production` currently revert to original town casters. Derive the default from the captured live state or label it as a reference configuration.\n- **Attribution:** `no-marvin` measures the net scene effect of removing Marvin—including shadows, AO and newly exposed background—not exclusive CAD cost. Encoding measurements are wall-clock elapsed time.\n- **Internals:** the 45-pixel restoration difference prevents attributing all 25 candidate differences specifically to removed parts. The roughly **0.32–0.38 ms** timing reduction merits recording, but establishes no safe removal.\n\nKeep provenance explicitly tied to pre-merge `db1be0f`. No production geometry or sidedness change is justified by these results."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a101d5-8257-70d1-a787-b5625f81d2bc","create_time":1791032663.009981}}}
