{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T13:31:48.023Z","ordinal":17911,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","turn_id":"01a101e4-6089-7ec1-acf2-e00d6778da4f","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_08092949d98b672f016ac103c0aac887d2942c4def852a91f9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Reordering saved roughly **0.2–0.4 ms** in the first native test, but it also changed 796 pixels slightly. Before attributing either result to index order, I’m adding the judge’s recommended control: reconstruct the geometry with its original indices. That will separate reordering from SceneKit’s handling of a newly created geometry object.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791034304671,"completed_at_ms":1791034308023}}
