{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:16:33.405Z","ordinal":18505,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1021f-af7d-7550-a220-560b67c70ea6","author":"/root/cad_enclosure_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/cad_enclosure_audit\nPayload:\nAdded [check-cad-enclosure.py](/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin/scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py).\n\n- Requires only NumPy; derives components directly from runtime assets.\n- Verifies exact coordinate representation, closed topology, winding, vertex links, convexity and minimum clearance.\n- Retains all certifying `Body` geometry.\n- Binds assets, source, script and output indices with SHA256.\n- Includes meaningful negative fixtures via `--self-test`.\n\nExecuted:\n\n```sh\npython scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py --self-test --output <artifact-directory>\n```\n\nSelf-tests passed. The current assets reproduce **27,756 enclosed triangles**; all 20 per-shell index arrays exactly match the earlier certificate.\n\nArtifacts: `/Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix/cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier/`\n\nOnly the assigned repository script was edited. No process remains running."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10203-cbf2-7142-9114-67ec5e108a8c","create_time":1791036993.405175}}}
