{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:21:47.642Z","ordinal":18632,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_08092949d98b672f016ac10f5f4a6887d28dd6f618412cb6ee","status":"completed","call_id":"call_qIxphixkoOeZ4iK3LnzaGYsJ","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport shutil,json\\nroot=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin')\\np=root/'docs/performance-validation/2026-10-03/cad-geometry'\\nanalysis=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix')\\nfor name in ['enclosure-certificate.json','enclosure-indices.npz']:\\n shutil.copy2(analysis/'cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier'/name,p/name)\\nshutil.copy2(analysis/'cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier.log',p/'enclosure-verifier.log')\\nfor name in ['loaded-gpu-probe.json','image-comparison.json','run-source.json']:\\n shutil.copy2(analysis/'track-batch-probe-15'/name,p/('track-batch-'+name))\\ndoc=root/'docs/renderer-study.md'\\ns=doc.read_text()\\ns += '''\\nThe reusable verifier is `scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py` (Python 3.10+\\nand NumPy). Run `python3 scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py --self-test\\n--output /tmp/marvin-enclosure`. It derives the shells directly from current\\nruntime assets, writes an exact containment certificate and original triangle\\nindices, and never modifies the assets. Negative fixtures cover open/nonconvex\\nshells, winding/duplicate failures, boundary/insufficient clearance, a triangle\\nwhose centroid is inside but a vertex is outside, and oblique planes with unequal\\nnon-unit coordinate scales. The saved run passed and reproduces 27,756 triangles.\\nAstra Ultra approved the repeatable geometric proof for an isolated candidate;\\nruntime opacity and relative transforms remain explicitly reviewed conditions.\\nSource hashes bind evidence to files but do not enforce those conditions.\\n\\nThe frozen tread batching prototype (`MARVIN_GPU_VARIANTS=track-batch-control,track-batch`\\nwith `--benchmark-gpu-probe`) retained all 325,248 triangles and 263,424 vertices,\\ncombining 224 shoe/rib nodes into four batches. Original-geometry reconstruction\\ncontrols were pixel-identical. CPU encoding medians fell from about 2.7 ms to\\n1.705/1.706 ms, but GPU medians were 11.612/11.594 ms versus bracketing production\\n11.620/11.496 ms: no established GPU improvement. Candidate images changed 2,365\\npixels by at most 6/255; restoration changed 30 pixels by at most 4/255, so strict\\nrestoration equivalence failed. The saved candidate image was inspected. No\\nanimated batching or production change is accepted from this experiment. Raw\\nsamples, image comparison and the exact binary hash are saved beside the CAD\\nreports. CPU submission savings remain a separate possible follow-up.\\n'''\\ndoc.write_text(s)\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:2000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git diff --check && git rev-list --left-right --count HEAD...origin/codex/mos-aster-racing-city\",workdir:\"/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin\",max_output_tokens:2000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10203-cbf2-7142-9114-67ec5e108a8c","create_time":1791037277.117511}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:21:47.694Z","ordinal":18633,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","turn_id":"01a10203-cbf2-7142-9114-67ec5e108a8c","session_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","root_turn_id":"01a10203-cbf2-7142-9114-67ec5e108a8c","response_id":"resp_08092949d98b672f016ac10f5c0c8887d2a5c02b51c1ab8147","usage":{"input_tokens":72038,"cached_input_tokens":71808,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":714,"reasoning_output_tokens":11,"total_tokens":72752},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":9087920,"cached_input_tokens":8994688,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":30273,"reasoning_output_tokens":9682,"total_tokens":9118193},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":316649335,"cached_input_tokens":312214656,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":935432,"reasoning_output_tokens":322383,"total_tokens":317584767}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:21:47.765Z","ordinal":18634,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","turn_id":"01a10203-cbf2-7142-9114-67ec5e108a8c","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-4823c1fb-09e8-42e2-97c8-c2f4d8db5a68","process_id":"21854","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport shutil,json\nroot=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin')\np=root/'docs/performance-validation/2026-10-03/cad-geometry'\nanalysis=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix')\nfor name in ['enclosure-certificate.json','enclosure-indices.npz']:\n shutil.copy2(analysis/'cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier'/name,p/name)\nshutil.copy2(analysis/'cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier.log',p/'enclosure-verifier.log')\nfor name in ['loaded-gpu-probe.json','image-comparison.json','run-source.json']:\n shutil.copy2(analysis/'track-batch-probe-15'/name,p/('track-batch-'+name))\ndoc=root/'docs/renderer-study.md'\ns=doc.read_text()\ns += '''\nThe reusable verifier is `scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py` (Python 3.10+\nand NumPy). Run `python3 scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py --self-test\n--output /tmp/marvin-enclosure`. It derives the shells directly from current\nruntime assets, writes an exact containment certificate and original triangle\nindices, and never modifies the assets. Negative fixtures cover open/nonconvex\nshells, winding/duplicate failures, boundary/insufficient clearance, a triangle\nwhose centroid is inside but a vertex is outside, and oblique planes with unequal\nnon-unit coordinate scales. The saved run passed and reproduces 27,756 triangles.\nAstra Ultra approved the repeatable geometric proof for an isolated candidate;\nruntime opacity and relative transforms remain explicitly reviewed conditions.\nSource hashes bind evidence to files but do not enforce those conditions.\n\nThe frozen tread batching prototype (`MARVIN_GPU_VARIANTS=track-batch-control,track-batch`\nwith `--benchmark-gpu-probe`) retained all 325,248 triangles and 263,424 vertices,\ncombining 224 shoe/rib nodes into four batches. Original-geometry reconstruction\ncontrols were pixel-identical. CPU encoding medians fell from about 2.7 ms to\n1.705/1.706 ms, but GPU medians were 11.612/11.594 ms versus bracketing production\n11.620/11.496 ms: no established GPU improvement. Candidate images changed 2,365\npixels by at most 6/255; restoration changed 30 pixels by at most 4/255, so strict\nrestoration equivalence failed. The saved candidate image was inspected. No\nanimated batching or production change is accepted from this experiment. Raw\nsamples, image comparison and the exact binary hash are saved beside the CAD\nreports. CPU submission savings remain a separate possible follow-up.\n'''\ndoc.write_text(s)\nPY"],"cwd":"file:///Users/thomi/Projects","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport shutil,json\nroot=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin')\np=root/'docs/performance-validation/2026-10-03/cad-geometry'\nanalysis=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix')\nfor name in ['enclosure-certificate.json','enclosure-indices.npz']:\n shutil.copy2(analysis/'cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier'/name,p/name)\nshutil.copy2(analysis/'cad-enclosure/reusable-verifier.log',p/'enclosure-verifier.log')\nfor name in ['loaded-gpu-probe.json','image-comparison.json','run-source.json']:\n shutil.copy2(analysis/'track-batch-probe-15'/name,p/('track-batch-'+name))\ndoc=root/'docs/renderer-study.md'\ns=doc.read_text()\ns += '''\nThe reusable verifier is `scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py` (Python 3.10+\nand NumPy). Run `python3 scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py --self-test\n--output /tmp/marvin-enclosure`. It derives the shells directly from current\nruntime assets, writes an exact containment certificate and original triangle\nindices, and never modifies the assets. Negative fixtures cover open/nonconvex\nshells, winding/duplicate failures, boundary/insufficient clearance, a triangle\nwhose centroid is inside but a vertex is outside, and oblique planes with unequal\nnon-unit coordinate scales. The saved run passed and reproduces 27,756 triangles.\nAstra Ultra approved the repeatable geometric proof for an isolated candidate;\nruntime opacity and relative transforms remain explicitly reviewed conditions.\nSource hashes bind evidence to files but do not enforce those conditions.\n\nThe frozen tread batching prototype (`MARVIN_GPU_VARIANTS=track-batch-control,track-batch`\nwith `--benchmark-gpu-probe`) retained all 325,248 triangles and 263,424 vertices,\ncombining 224 shoe/rib nodes into four batches. Original-geometry reconstruction\ncontrols were pixel-identical. CPU encoding medians fell from about 2.7 ms to\n1.705/1.706 ms, but GPU medians were 11.612/11.594 ms versus bracketing production\n11.620/11.496 ms: no established GPU improvement. Candidate images changed 2,365\npixels by at most 6/255; restoration changed 30 pixels by at most 4/255, so strict\nrestoration equivalence failed. The saved candidate image was inspected. No\nanimated batching or production change is accepted from this experiment. Raw\nsamples, image comparison and the exact binary hash are saved beside the CAD\nreports. CPU submission savings remain a separate possible follow-up.\n'''\ndoc.write_text(s)\nPY"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":1292},"formatted_output":""},"started_at_ms":1791037307765,"completed_at_ms":1791037307765}}
