{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:25:39.739Z","ordinal":18708,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_08092949d98b672f016ac1104c2f8087d2905eb1f95aeb2126","status":"completed","call_id":"call_2za2UhL7QAcShfSjU6SpEDIM","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport shutil\\nroot=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin')\\nevidence=root/'docs/performance-validation/2026-10-03/cad-geometry'\\nrun=Path('/Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix/track-batch-local-15')\\nfor name in ['loaded-gpu-probe.json','image-comparison.json','run-source.json']:\\n shutil.copy2(run/name,evidence/('track-batch-local-'+name))\\np=root/'docs/renderer-study.md'\\ns=p.read_text().replace('Run `python3 scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py --self-test\\\\n--output /tmp/marvin-enclosure`. It derives the shells directly from current','Run:\\\\n\\\\n```sh\\\\npython3 scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py --self-test --output /tmp/marvin-enclosure\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nIt derives the shells directly from current')\\ns+='''\\nA follow-up corrected the prototype's world-coordinate round trip by composing\\nshoe/rib local transforms directly. The rebuilt native run confirms zero spurious\\nshoe X displacement. CPU encoding remains about 1.71–1.73 ms versus 2.71–2.75 ms;\\nGPU medians are 11.573/11.612 ms versus bracketing 11.425/11.465 ms, so this test\\nregresses GPU time slightly. It changed 2,226 pixels by at most 7/255; copy controls\\nand early restored baselines differed by two pixels at 1/255, and final restoration\\nby 35 pixels at up to 7/255. Exact visual controls therefore still fail. The native\\ncandidate image was inspected. The committed prototype uses the corrected local\\ntransforms, remains diagnostic-only, and is not a validated gameplay optimization.\\n'''\\np.write_text(s)\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:2000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git diff --check && git add apps/simulator-macos/Sources/MarvinSimulator/LoadedGPUProbe.swift apps/simulator-macos/Sources/MarvinSimulator/TownSmoke.swift apps/simulator-macos/Sources/MarvinSimulator/MarvinVisibilityAudit.swift apps/simulator-macos/Sources/MarvinSimulator/TrackBatchProbe.swift scripts/rendering/check-cad-enclosure.py docs/renderer-study.md docs/performance-validation/2026-10-03/cad-geometry && git diff --cached --stat\",workdir:\"/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin\",max_output_tokens:3500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a10203-cbf2-7142-9114-67ec5e108a8c","create_time":1791037511.16437}}}
